	<h4 style="text-align:center;">The Salvation Army of The Midlands</h4>
	<p style="text-align:center;">
	Serving Fairfield, Kershaw, Lexington, Newberry, Calhoun, Orangeburg, Bamberg, and Richland Counties<br>
	&nbsp;
</p>
	<p style="text-align:center;;color:#fff>
	<a href="https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/midlands/volunteer" target=""><span class="btn btn-solid btn-red">VOLUNTEER</span></a>
</p>
	<div class="row my-3">
<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
<p><strong>GIVE HELP</strong></p>
<p>When you support The Salvation Army, you are making a difference in the lives of people in your community.</p>
<p>
					<strong>Make a Financial Gift</strong>
				</p>
<p><a href="https://give.salvationarmycarolinas.org/give/427453/#!/donation/checkout?amount=100&amp;recurring=0&amp;c_src=WebsiteUSS&amp;c_src2=PrimaryDonateButton" target="">Donate Online</a></p>
<p><a href="tel:8007252769" target="">1-800-SAL-ARMY</a>&nbsp;(800-725-2769)</p>
<p><strong>By Mail:</strong></p>
<p>The Salvation Army of the Midlands</p>
<p>P.O. Box 2786</p>
<p>Columbia, SC 29202</p>
<p>
					Thank you for your generous gift. It&nbsp;will be proudly used to serve people in our local community.
				</p>
<p>
					<strong>Donate a Vehicle:</strong>
				</p>
<p>
					<a href="https://careasy.org/thesalvationarmyofmidlandscolumbiasc" target="">Visit our vehicle donation page</a>&nbsp;for more information about how donating a vehicle can help change lives.
				</p>
<p><strong>Volunteer</strong></p>
<p>For additional information about volunteering, please email:</p>
<p><a href="mailto:Shannon.chapman@uss.salvationarmy.org">Shannon.chapman@uss.salvationarmy.org</a> or call&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="tel:803-765-0260" target="">803-309-3244</a></p>
<div class="py-5"></div>
<div class="py-5"></div>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
<p><strong>GET HELP</strong></p>
<p>If you are in need of support, there are many ways The Salvation Army may be able to help. Please feel free to contact us about the services below:</p>
<ul>
					<li>Worship</li>
					<li>Disaster Relief</li>
					<li>Christmas Assistance</li>
					<li>Homelessness Prevention Services</li>
					<li>Clothing and Furniture Vouchers</li>
					<li>Rent &amp; Utilities Emergency Assistance</li>
					<li>Food Pantry</li>
					<li>Afterschool Programs</li>
					<li>Meal Service for those experiencing homelessness</li>
				</ul>
<p>
					<strong>Spiritual Help</strong>
				</p>
<p>
					In addition to our social ministries, The Salvation Army is a Christian Evangelical Church and we hold weekly worship services.&nbsp;
				</p>
<p>
					<strong>For assistance and/or to reach our Social Services Department</strong>
				</p>
<p>Phone:&nbsp;<a href="tel:803-765-0260" target="">803-765-0260</a></p>
<p>Email: <a href="mailto:midlandssc@uss.salvationarmy.org" target="">nscMidlands.Services@uss.salvationarmy.org</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p>
					<strong>GENERAL INQUIRIES</strong>
				</p>
<p>Phone:&nbsp;<a href="tel:803-765-0260" target="">803-765-0260</a></p>
<p>Email:&nbsp;<a href="mailto:midlandssc@uss.salvationarmy.org" target="">midlandsSC@uss.salvationarmy.org</a></p>
<p><strong>Street Address:</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
